# tests/sub-run, as an ENTRY (design/caos-expr.md, Phase 3): evaluating this
# directory yields the test's ARG TREE, which dev/run-test then runs.
#
# A WORKER TEST. `sub-run` is a worker verb — it exists so a job can dispatch
# work it will not wait for — and every part here is a worker: one Go program
# that plays the test, the self-dispatching fixture, the launcher and the
# detached job, chosen by --role.
curry --base:@=DEEP-DEPS/go --worker1:@=worker.go
